{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>朱敏瀚（朱仔）日前為TVB《萬千星輝賀台慶》當晚的重頭戲表演「極速狂奔 Speed and Stunt」進行綵排時發生意外，因道具木架突然倒塌，令他頓時失去平衡跌落地，目測高約兩米，整個人背部直接著地重摔，幸好朱敏瀚身手敏捷，經初步檢查後並無大礙。經過數日休息後，朱敏瀚已迅速恢復狀態，並在社交平台大曬做Gym相報平安！</p><figure><img alt=\"朱敏瀚。（IG@brianchu0523）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260930/1181976174797262848284701.jpeg/ZCvLkhd0gDctIiwGAieQjvSE0kocoHsL_25GP_9uRj8\"/><figcaption>朱敏瀚。（IG@brianchu0523）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"周嘉洛、朱敏瀚、劉穎鏇。（IG@brianchu0523）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261031/1193267713506545664409586.jpeg/1v5UDkV5aov8BJReif3wBmtCIYgHPi-uDv78CA7-_Ag\"/><figcaption>周嘉洛、朱敏瀚、劉穎鏇。（IG@brianchu0523）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱敏瀚（朱仔）日前為TVB《萬千星輝賀台慶》當晚的重頭戲表演「極速狂奔 Speed and Stunt」進行綵排時發生意外。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261031/1193264099895545856540173.jpeg/nUoZCr2s64QWeJ-jusR9lFCCEHDAXCEoGs6qLxrOqi8\"/><figcaption>朱敏瀚（朱仔）日前為TVB《萬千星輝賀台慶》當晚的重頭戲表演「極速狂奔 Speed and Stunt」進行綵排時發生意外。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"木架倒塌。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261031/1193264111644315648608427.jpeg/g5qskHEhLmE962e001eWFA9pG1DYAU_Cqn-dcKp_nXA\"/><figcaption>木架倒塌。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"失足跌下。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261031/1193264317345042432524186.jpeg/OkuzPgdquzQFU-IDUOjoseXKVdNtbOL1N4dAcjeHQHI\"/><figcaption>失足跌下。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"驚險。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261031/1193264109576392704586134.jpeg/HdEKFrW40vR9v1hx8m3T1OjH5yDXSk-3tK-bfLSvm3w\"/><figcaption>驚險。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"幸無大礙。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261031/1193264107344891904602814.jpeg/hpCatoWV1We4rZzQq2RTH55CUvAvQOi-leqtzJXqrcw\"/><figcaption>幸無大礙。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"幸無大礙。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261031/1193264102969970688301475.jpeg/yTRJyDNN0FCFabvtdfD11h5VIdxzA9Pj6b4uVum-LlY\"/><figcaption>幸無大礙。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>朱敏瀚台慶綵排意外後報平安　孖好兄弟操肌：唔好俾佢停</p><p>朱敏瀚在IG曬出與好兄弟周嘉洛、張振朗及關曜儁於Gym Room操肌健身的合照，並寫道：「多謝大家關心🥰掂晒 繼續操嘢 唔好俾佢停」。相中所見，朱敏瀚笑容滿面，並對着鏡頭豎起大拇指，活力十足！</p><figure><img alt=\"繼續操肌！（IG@brianchu0523）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194282344911998976367592.jpeg/jWzL2mB2mL51ca3cX407t1q6pgxcSlE24xTk_OMU5Pw\"/><figcaption>繼續操肌！（IG@brianchu0523）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大隻！（IG@brianchu0523）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261031/1193267716212002816065143.jpeg/lkJcNNGHjOSls6JFNem5XyZeFk55Uz0775U_Y--VP2M\"/><figcaption>大隻！（IG@brianchu0523）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱敏瀚、周嘉洛、張振朗和關曜儁完成接力賽。（IG@owencheung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260513/1131234820936962048328790.jpeg/xsT6oVKH0WX4wWY2lOqT4z_FJotpnGW0kyrrvZMq670\"/><figcaption>朱敏瀚、周嘉洛、張振朗和關曜儁完成接力賽。（IG@owencheung）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:02:18.264654+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":544,"images":11,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T05:45:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:19:15.822313+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T05:58:57.628803+00:00","content_hash":"bde81a7aa07f22e9aeeda82da813e711cb1b5089981138dce913076df3c702c6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}